"Lax1dude","glsl/deferred/shader_pack_icon.png","Guns Mod","1.3.7","A new and exciting weapon mod with a unique vision. Adding nine weapons, all can be highly customised to create your own unique variant. Using attachments and enchantments, you can increase the stats of a weapon to create an even more powerful version. Dyes can be used to change the colour of any weapon and attachment. This mod also adds grenades and stun grenades!","MrCrayfish","MIT","eaglerz/mods/guns.png","ViaVersion Items","v2.0","A mod that adds items from newer versions of Minecraft to older versions, allowing you to experience content from future updates right now! This mod is a client-side addon for ViaVersion and requires it to function. Adding new Items, Blocks, and more from newer versions of Minecraft to older versions. Note: This mod is purely cosmetic and does not add any new mechanics or features from the newer versions.",
"UrBudPenguin","eaglerz/mods/viaversion.png","EaglercraftZ Test Mod","1.0.0","This does nothing so install it if you want but it won\'t do anything.","Unlicensed","eaglerz/mods/favicon.png","A simple mod that makes everything fully bright all the time. No more dark caves or night time!","eaglerz/mods/fullbright.png","A mod that shows a fake FPS counter on the screen to make you feel better about your performance and others around you.","eaglerz/mods/fake.png","Wisp Proxy","A patch for eaglercraft that allows joining regular online mode minecraft servers from the browser, tunneled over wisp.",
"MecuryWorkshop","eaglerz/mods/wisp.png","1.2.0 Beta","A mod that hides your password when you typing in your password in a multiplayer server. Bascialy hides anything you type in the command!","eaglerz/mods/hide_password.png","Nostalgia Shaders","v5.1","Capturing the essence of old shaderpacks to create a stylized and modern Minecraft-look.","RRe36","Custom License","eaglerz/mods/nostalgia_shaders.png","Mace Port","Vanilla friendly Backport of the 1.21 Mace weapon!","DerexXD","eaglerz/mods/mace_port.png","FPS Boost Mod",
